# 7. Universal Indicatrix, Whirligig, and Scrollsaw

## Universal Indicatrix

The strongest mathematically usable UI core is:

\[
y(\lambda)
=
r(\lambda)R(\lambda)x_0,
\qquad
R(\lambda)\in SO(4).
\]

Its velocity decomposition is:

\[
\dot y
=
\dot r\,R x_0
+
r\,\dot R x_0
=
\frac{\dot r}{r}y
+
\Omega y,
\]

with

\[
\Omega=\dot R R^{-1}.
\]

This is a legitimate kinematic generator.

The UI should be assigned these roles:

