This supplies distinct interfaces for:

- history-evolution inertia;
- first-gradient or tension-like response;
- bending;
- local constitutive behavior;
- interaction.

It is a mechanical test kernel, not a completed account of matter or spacetime.

The interaction term should remain decomposed:

\[
S_{\rm int}
=
S_{\rm contact}
+
S_{\rm excluded}
+
S_{\rm local}
+
S_{\rm nonlocal}
+
S_{\rm topological}
