=
X_n(s)
+
F_n(s)P_n(s)\xi_{n+1}(s),
\]

with:

- \(F_n\in SO(4)\);
- \(P_n:\mathbb R^2\hookrightarrow N_sX_n\);
- \(\xi_{n+1}:I\rightarrow\mathbb R^2\).

This should be the definition of:

