(\mathcal W_1,\dots,\mathcal W_N,\beta,\mathcal L,\mathcal K).
\]

It requires:

- multiple strands;
- strand identity;
- exchange data;
- linking/closure data;
- contact rules.

Neither a single harmonic curve nor a multipane UI trajectory is automatically a braid.

